        "filename": "java/gen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T23:12:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose I can add an aidl_export_dirs to framework.jar blueprint, and then anybody who links against framework.jar will get the aidl include dirs.  That\u0027s not exactly the same as the current logic, anybody who sets no_default_libraries won\u0027t get the include directories, but that\u0027s probably OK.",
      "parentUuid": "03868e96_af948545",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 38,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 53,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "7f303e0e45e89bec04c2174bd65201d4c35a0bd7",
