      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T22:41:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we support more general genrule yet?\nI think aidl-preocess is run only once in the whole build process. It maybe overkill to have a new module type for this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "7f303e0e45e89bec04c2174bd65201d4c35a0bd7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "03868e96_8f0d0139",
        "filename": "java/gen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T22:52:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a simple gensrcs rule that can take a single input file and produce a single output file that can be used as a C source file, but this one takes multiple inputs and produces something with type safety to be consumed by javaBase.collectDeps, so it isn\u0027t reusable.  A module type is pretty cheap.",
      "parentUuid": "237f124e_566f12f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "7f303e0e45e89bec04c2174bd65201d4c35a0bd7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "03868e96_7af159e2",
        "filename": "java/gen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003981
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T23:06:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even though it\u0027s cheap to add new module type, there may be big number of such cases. It would be much easier (especially for the developers) to do it in just blueprint file like:\ngenrule {\n  srcs: [...],\n  deps: [...],\n  cmd: [...],\n  \n}\n\nI have the same concern about the above list of directories. People won\u0027t want to dig into the .go files to find where to add a directory.",
      "parentUuid": "03868e96_8f0d0139",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "7f303e0e45e89bec04c2174bd65201d4c35a0bd7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "03868e96_fa9f2934",
        "filename": "java/gen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T23:12:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem with a genrule is knowing what the output is.  A java library will end up with a blueprint dependency on the framework.aidl genrule module, but it needs to know that the result is a preprocessed aidl that should be passed to -p, and not a generated aidl source file that should be passed as an input to aidl, and that is assuming that we guess that it is an aidl file based on the extension.",
      "parentUuid": "03868e96_7af159e2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 4
      },
